    "title": "TiviMate IPTV Player",
    "description": "IMPORTANT! TiviMate doesn't provide any sources of TV channels. It is a player only. You need to add a playlist from your IPTV provider to be able to watch TV channels.\r\n\r\nThe app is intended for Android TV devices and is not optimized for phones and tablets.\r\n\r\nThe main features:\r\n\u2022 Modern user interface designed for big screens\r\n\u2022 Support for multiple playlists\r\n\u2022 Scheduled TV guide update\r\n\u2022 Favorite channels\r\n\u2022 Catch-up\r\n\u2022 Search\r\n\u2022 and much more",
